Worst game in the series, because:
- lack of parkour elements;
- bad controls (better than in Unity, though);
- ships;
- boring plot;
- unbalanced combat (especially, the Ultimate Counter-Attack);
- useless collectibles;
- a lot of pirats, instead of assassins;
- terrible protagonist;
- strongly reminds Far Cry 3;
- ships.
I'd recommend any of the previous ones or stand-alone DLC Freedom Cry.

