Okay, maybe u are one of those, who need "reasons" to buy this beauty. Ok here s the list:
-Marvelous soundtrack: check;
-Great gameplay: check;
-Optimal controls: check;
-Gorgeous 2D graphics: check;
-Lots of enemies to kill: check;
