If u still thinking wherever to buy it or not, probably you didnt want to buy it from the start. But belive me, as soon as u start playing, u wont let it go untill the very end.

This game is one of my all time favorites. I bought it expecting the length of Ori (beat in 5 hours or so) instead i got a grand adventure of 25 hours with much left to do.
Hollow Knight stands out from other metriodvania's by using melee combat, interchangable charms, and the ability to heal whenever (this is great till you get into a boss battle). This game is long but beautiful all the way (
). Never thought in all of gameing that your best friends would be an ant and a mosquito.

